WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.160 --> 00:00:03.280
Another thing Dr. Bright is not&nbsp;
allowed to do at the Foundation:&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:03.280 --> 00:00:06.480
Dr. Bright! You cannot make Mythbuster!

00:00:06.480 --> 00:00:10.480
The hosts of the classic television show&nbsp;
Mythbusters are experts in their field,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:10.480 --> 00:00:15.920
and no, Dr. Bright, you can't "do it better"&nbsp;
than them. Dr. Bright is strictly prohibited&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:15.920 --> 00:00:21.280
from using any SCP to recreate experiments he saw&nbsp;
while binge-watching old episodes of the show.

00:00:21.280 --> 00:00:24.400
Please don't put SCP-999 in a cannon again,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:24.400 --> 00:00:29.040
the poor thing was motion sick for the rest of&nbsp;
the day and it took ages to clean up the mess.

